      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَوْزَبٌ</span></b>  A camel <i>strong in running;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوِىُّ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الجَرْىِ</span>: (K, and so in a copy of the S:) or a
<i>strong and bold</i> camel; syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوِىٌّ جَرِىءٌ</span>: (so in
the S, in several copies): a <i>strong</i> camel: (ElJarmee:) a camel <i>advanced in age, and bold.</i>
(As.) ― 
